[{"id":1148142,"tag_name":"v0.1.0","target_commitish":"20cc88345e48a119be4dc49b72064d2d2cd0b5e8","prerelease":false,"name":"0.1.0","body":"# BUAA Schedule 0.1.0\r\n\r\n北航专用课程表。首个公开发布版本。\r\n\r\n## 能做什么\r\n\r\n- 登录学校统一身份认证（WebView）抓取课表，导入前逐条预览确认，确认之前不落库\r\n- 也支持分享口令 / ICS 文件 / 纯文本导入，以及手动增删改课程\r\n- 周视图与今日时间轴双模式，横滑翻周、宽屏双栏并排、10 级排版刻度、液态玻璃（默认开启）\r\n- 5 种桌面组件（今日 / 明日 / 本周课表 / 4×2 网格 / 下一节课），外观按组件实例分别可配\r\n- 课前提醒、上课铃与下课铃、自动勿扰；澎湃超级岛与 ColorOS 流体云实况（课前倒计时 + 课中进度）\r\n- 系统日历增量同步、WakeUp 兼容导出、备份与恢复\r\n- 应用内检查更新：直接从本 Release 下载安装包\r\n\r\n## 装之前先看一眼\r\n\r\n- 需要 Android 8.0 及以上\r\n- MIUI/HyperOS 上实况与后台闹钟需要在「设置 → 应用 → BUAA Schedule → 权限」里放行**后台弹出界面**，\r\n  并按首启引导的提示关掉电池优化。不放行的后果只是提醒可能延迟，不会丢课表数据\r\n- 本 Release 有两个附件：`buaa-schedule-0.1.0.apk` 是正式签名包，应用内更新只会下这一个；\r\n  `buaa-schedule-0.1.0-debug.apk` 是调试签名的自测包，两者签名不同，**不要**互相覆盖安装\r\n- 课表数据只存在本机，不上传任何服务器；对学校的网络请求只发生在你主动发起的登录/导入过程里，\r\n  更新检查只访问 Gitee 的公开接口\r\n","author":{"id":17581161,"login":"alyssumira","name":"Alyssumira","avatar_url":"https://foruda.gitee.com/avatar/1789493060355665329/17581161_alyssumira_1789493060.png","url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/alyssumira","html_url":"https://gitee.com/alyssumira","remark":"","followers_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/alyssumira/followers","following_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/alyssumira/following_url{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/alyssumira/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/alyssumira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/alyssumira/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/alyssumira/orgs","repos_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/alyssumira/repos","events_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/alyssumira/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/alyssumira/received_events","type":"User"},"created_at":"2026-09-16T21:48:46+08:00","assets":[{"browser_download_url":"https://gitee.com/alyssumira/buaa-schedule/releases/download/v